<Slide style={{ padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>04 · 工程底座：六种运行形态</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 12, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            从个人工具到多人协作，半径逐级放大；每一步都配套相应的隔离与合规措施。
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, flexWrap: 'wrap', flex: 1, alignContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 386, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 5, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>1</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', flex: 1 }}>本地一键启动</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>macOS 与 Windows 双击运行，自动准备环境并复制演示数据。</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 386, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 5, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', flex: 1 }}>服务器部署</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>系统服务托管双站点，含备份、回滚与发布前检查脚本。</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 386, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 5, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>3</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', flex: 1 }}>加密隧道邀请预览</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>朋友在本机浏览器访问同一份题库，权限被限制为仅转发。</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 386, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 5, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>4</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', flex: 1 }}>只读展示站</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>独立服务与资源白名单，不读取个人数据，也不调用模型。</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 386, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 5, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>5</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', flex: 1 }}>账号多用户</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>按目录隔离各人工作区，公共母题以独立编号投影到个人库。</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 386, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 5, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>6</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', flex: 1 }}>原生客户端</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>覆盖手机、平板与电脑，本地缓存与草稿，共用云端接口。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 13, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>运维</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>日志按天滚动并保留 14 天，部署脚本含任务检查、数据备份与回滚前导出。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>合规</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>公开入口页展示备案信息，学习接口由访问保护隔离，不直接暴露。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 44, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F7F9FC', borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>高中数学 AI 学习系统 · 技术框架汇报</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>20 / 24</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
